    "causal_summary": "cli-classifier is the single public skill identity for classifier models served on this machine, a hub with one transport packet. The hub routes a judgment request to cli-deem through mode-registry.json and hub-router.json. The transport is one Node file that checks the local Deem server with health and asks it for a probability, one option key, an ordered level position or a batch of keyed answers, printed in the field names the existing typed-judgment readers parse. Write, Edit and Task are forbidden and mutatesWorkspace is false, so the transport selects while a workflow acts. The advisor sees one hub and resolves the transport by hub membership, because every transport is routingClass metadata.",
